      "comment": "ZARA'S SECRET (7) goes very well here starting nine times for four wins and four minors. Hit the frame latest (18.05) when second at this track in a Grade 3/4. Looks suited here and rates on top. TRUST ME (1) is drawn well on the inside. Last start finished 4th on October 6 over 312m at this track behind Bear The Brunt beaten 9 lengths (18.62) in a Grade 2/3. Among the main chances. RACCOON RIVER (2) collided in the run and missed the frame when eighth (23.60) at Mandurah over 400m in a Grade 5. Better than latest and worth another try. TERRITORY LIFE (3) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
